Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:16.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,师父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想学
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:19.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:24.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,国师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你又睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,罚抄十遍道德经
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:30.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道德经
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:33.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那还不如绕皇城跑十圈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:34.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,二十遍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:35.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在就抄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:37.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,字写好看点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.75,0:02:39.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:40.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,师父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:51.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:53.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,师父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:55.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想学新的剑法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之前的都学会了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:57.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:02:59.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:01.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你想学什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:06.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想学你救我的那招
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:09.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那招并不实用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,至少
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不适合你学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:14.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是很有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:16.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一剑化去两剑的劲力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这才救了我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:21.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:23.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我问你一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:24.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你问
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果你前面有两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:29.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们都饿得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:32.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为了抢夺对方的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:33.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,互相厮打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这个时候第三个人出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:38.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他劝这两个人不要打了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:40.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:42.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,结果会如何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毕竟饿肚子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:46.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,劝肯定没用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:47.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:50.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,光讲大道理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:52.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,粮食也不会因此多出一份
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:55.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若想停止纷争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:04:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这第三人便只能将二人之外的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:02.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己的粮食分给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而我那招也是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:08.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说我凭空化去了两剑的劲力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:09.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实并不正确
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:11.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:12.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,利剑出鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,势不可挡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:16.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就必然要有东西去承接其力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,物或者人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而两剑相争
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:22.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这第三人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:24.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,正是以己之身去承受前者的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,止干戈而自承其伤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:30.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你贵为太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:32.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这种愚蠢的招数更没有必要学
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:33.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有什么问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:43.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,师父
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:47.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果那第三个人的粮食也不够怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:51.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果那两个人有了粮食
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:53.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却因为贪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想要更多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打得更凶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不断向第三个人索取粮食
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:59.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那又该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:03.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:05.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:08.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:10.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也许
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:13.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,从一开始就不应该插手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,国师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:32.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:33.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-来了\N-千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:37.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,国师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:47.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:48.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,发生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:51.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:05:59.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:01.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:07.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:11.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:13.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:14.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:18.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,师父
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:20.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这是在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:22.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你干了什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,国师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:41.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你承认了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知这次会怎么发落啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:48.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想当初
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君可是对他青睐有加呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:51.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:52.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第二次飞升
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,两人不是打了一场吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:55.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐太子还捅了帝君好几剑呐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:59.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这仇肯定结下了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可你看看那新批的仙乐宫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:02.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙京最好的地段
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪像有仇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:06.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这仙乐太子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:08.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难不成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靠山硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐有个不情之请
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:14.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:16.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请帝君去我仙籍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:18.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,贬我下凡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:19.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:19.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这种请求还第一次见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:23.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,飞升是你的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:24.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不需要自贬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只要你跟我打一场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:27.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:28.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你以前也不是没跟我打过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:32.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:33.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟我打
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:35.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你必输无疑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:39.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不论生死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:40.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就此了结
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:41.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不需要你让我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请帝君贬我下界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:45.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:45.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,且慢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:46.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:47.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还有话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:52.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诸位仙僚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:55.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若仙乐殿下真是为报复才化名芳心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血洗永安皇室的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:07:58.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那么为何
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:01.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,独独放过了身为永安太子的泰华殿下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:02.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,照理说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他最想手刃的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:07.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不就应该是这位永安国的太子殿下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:09.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我虽与仙乐殿下相交时短
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:12.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但也亲眼见他为救泰华殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:14.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,正面迎击弯刀厄命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:15.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受此重伤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:17.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:20.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他若是真对永安皇室有恨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:22.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又怎会冒险去替你挡下这一刀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:23.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这可不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说不定是因为心虚愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:25.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那可是不祥邪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:27.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诅咒之刃呐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:29.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在座的诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:30.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,除了帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:34.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有谁敢说接上这么一击能全身而退
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我认为此事存疑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请帝君明察
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真羡慕太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能得风师大人一力担保
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:50.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仗义执言
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:54.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们家小裴可就没这个福分了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:57.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,裴将军可不要混淆视听
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小裴的事能一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可是亲眼见他恶行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:02.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,亲耳听他承认了的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:05.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那今日泰华殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不也是亲眼见仙乐殿下恶行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:09.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,亲耳听他承认了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:13.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么说来确实如此啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:16.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这跟小裴将军情况难道不一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他自己都承认了的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:19.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:20.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:21.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我承你的情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:23.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:24.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诸位稍安勿躁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,泰华
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你行事素来有些冲动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但遇事须得冷静处之
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:33.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,辨清来龙去脉后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:34.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再做定夺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:37.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:39.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你既然不肯全盘托出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便先收押在仙乐宫禁足
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:47.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之后我会亲自审问
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:48.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在那之前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:50.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们先不要见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:51.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:55.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君英明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君想问什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:09:59.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可以尽管审
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但无论最终结果如何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我誓与你决一死战
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:05.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,告退
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:11.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可否拜托你两件事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你讲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:18.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我鬼市带上来的那个少年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:22.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,劳烦你照看一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:24.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小事一桩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:25.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第二件呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:27.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是裴将军之后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:29.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还想找半月发难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:31.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还请风师大人施以援手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:32.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是不会让裴将军得手的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她在哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一个腌菜坛子里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,腌菜坛子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:40.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,腌菜坛子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:41.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放菩荠观里了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你有空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:46.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,劳烦把她取出来吹一吹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:51.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有劳了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第一次进来就是被禁足
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:14.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这兆头可真不怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:23.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:27.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,连殿内设施都和从前那座仙乐宫一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:45.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:47.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知怎样了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:58.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之后被贬下凡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:01.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,砸锅卖铁也得把极乐坊给赔上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,几十年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:04.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,几百年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:06.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大不了一辈子都折给他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎的骰子还在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,借来的运气是已经耗尽了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:32.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:33.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以为会是风信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:36.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他大概是不会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:38.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这是来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:41.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君是禁了你的足
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:44.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不准泰华殿下过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:45.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但可没说我不能来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你那右手老这么血淋淋拖着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:00.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怪不好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你爱用不用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正也没人会再送过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:07.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:10.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虽然帝君替我应急处理过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:11.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,手能动了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:13.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过有药好更快些
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然是好物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:26.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:29.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的杀了那些永安国的皇族
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:30.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:31.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这里又不是你的殿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你能来我就不能来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:41.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:43.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚才在神武殿的那些话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:44.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:52.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天我在神武殿上所说的每一句话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:55.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就收着点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:59.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,事到如今这副沉痛脸又是做给谁看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正没做给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:01.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你倒是有资格叫我滚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嘴上说的有多衷心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:10.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还不是熬不了几年就自己跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.63,0:14:11.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:12.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:15.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人人都说你是深明大义不忍见故主堕落
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还不都是借口
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:18.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-说穿了\N-你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:21.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就是不想再和一个废人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:23.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虚度光阴了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你懂个屁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:28.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:30.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,慕情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:33.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:38.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你以为谁都和你一样龌龊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:40.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,巴不得他坏事做绝你就高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:43.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你一向瞧不起我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:45.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可你看看你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过是五十步笑百步罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:51.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:01.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么就真打起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这俩以前不是这样的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:07.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,慕情从来讲话都是细声细气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.25,0:15:09.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-绝对不会跟人对着吼\N-今天我就让你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:12.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-风信也是从来都听我的话\N-一会儿被我揍得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:14.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-让打就打让停就停\N-满地找牙的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你可别跪下来跟我求饶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:18.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都长大了拉不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:21.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是找外援吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:39.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,盾开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要站在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快到盾后面来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要用手碰那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:53.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:55.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:57.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明明挺可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:21.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你好大的胆子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟敢来仙京劫人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,未免太猖狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:28.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快放开殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:32.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们神官在我的地盘不也挺猖狂的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:34.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我说了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.50,0:16:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把人放下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:41.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就看你们有没有这个本事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:43.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:54.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:54.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:56.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:58.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风信
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:16:59.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:00.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:02.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么事需要吼这么大声
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,耳膜都要炸裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:04.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:05.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪个殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南阳将军
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:08.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:09.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快通报帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:11.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢怜跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:13.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:14.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:19.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐宫外不是一堆小神官看着的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:20.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只能进不能出的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.63,0:17:21.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:23.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你少添乱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:25.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是跑了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:26.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟人跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.13,0:17:28.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是被人劫走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:29.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,劫走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这里可是仙京
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁人这么嚣张
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:32.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁敢在帝君眼皮底下劫人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人人人真没了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:38.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我刚听灵文殿的小官说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:39.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐宫空了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:40.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:41.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:42.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千真万确啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:43.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:45.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还听不听得到我们说话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:46.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你现在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:47.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,胆大包天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:48.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-殿下 殿下\N-当我们大小天神是摆设啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:50.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-你听得到我们说话吗\N-往哪个方向跑了 我们去追
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:51.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诸位镇定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:00.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,许久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:01.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:03.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:09.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们有没有想我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正我是一点也没有想你们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:16.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:18.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我最近确实有点闲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:21.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也有段时间没跟各位切磋切磋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:24.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是有人正巧也闲得慌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:26.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想过来找我挑战叙旧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:29.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那也是热烈欢迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:30.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我靠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:32.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:33.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:37.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别理他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:38.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:40.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:46.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎这是为了救我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:47.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:02.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我凭什么觉得三郎是来救我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我才烧了极乐坊和兵器库
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:23.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎自然应该是来兴师问罪的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:25.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:27.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:29.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为何要说对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:32.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你对我知无不言
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:35.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我却隐瞒了查地师失踪之事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:36.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,骗了你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:38.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你盛情款待
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:41.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我却烧了你的极乐坊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有那全是珍品的兵器库
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:47.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我好生过意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过我马上要被贬了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:53.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下来之后一定想办法补偿你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:55.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-看怎么样才能弥补损失\N-为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:03.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你为什么要补偿我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:05.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明明是我伤了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:06.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是你伤了我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:09.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你忘了我一刀震伤了你一条手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:11.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说右手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:13.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:14.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:14.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:15.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还能动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:17.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我害你受那么重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:19.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么你还能笑着跟我说对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:22.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还反过来说要补偿我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我自己上去迎击才受的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本来就怨不得你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:38.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
